WEBVTT

00:49.966 --> 00:52.677
ALL CHARACTERS, LOCATIONS,
ORGANIZATIONS, RELIGIONS,

00:52.761 --> 00:55.555
EVENTS, AND OCCUPATIONS
IN THIS DRAMA ARE FICTITIOUS

01:06.107 --> 01:10.487
The building representative
took Mr. Kim out,

01:10.570 --> 01:12.113
and they both seemed weird…

01:15.909 --> 01:17.077
Hi.

01:19.204 --> 01:20.872
Mr. Kim.

01:21.831 --> 01:22.665
Hey.

01:27.796 --> 01:29.255
Are you thirsty too?

01:30.924 --> 01:32.509
Don't you dare mess with her.

01:33.468 --> 01:35.678
If you have anything to say, talk to me.

01:37.889 --> 01:39.015
You too, Mr. Kim.

01:40.642 --> 01:44.062
Sae-bom, we should look for the infected.

01:44.145 --> 01:46.606
They might not know
if they've been infected or not.

01:47.190 --> 01:50.235
Detective, stand up straight.
You're restoring order.

01:53.363 --> 01:56.783
This house still has lots of food
and drinking water left.

01:57.283 --> 01:59.577
We'll be staying home,

02:00.328 --> 02:02.622
so please stop this and leave.

02:02.705 --> 02:04.207
Right now.

02:04.791 --> 02:09.003
I'm running out of patience.

02:09.087 --> 02:11.005
Look at her, glaring at me.

02:11.840 --> 02:13.550
Come on. Aim your gun at her!

02:36.698 --> 02:38.533
That guy really is nuts.

02:41.786 --> 02:42.829
Look here.

02:43.413 --> 02:44.789
Are you looking for something?

02:45.331 --> 02:46.583
What should I get you?

02:49.335 --> 02:50.670
I was just…

02:52.088 --> 02:53.882
It doesn't seem like a newlyweds' home.

02:53.965 --> 02:55.550
It does without you here.

02:57.343 --> 03:01.764
By the way, we shouldn't let
the kid stay here, should we?

03:01.848 --> 03:03.558
What if she gets bitten by you two?

03:03.641 --> 03:06.269
Then where should she go to?
To your house?

03:06.352 --> 03:07.437
That's an option.

03:08.062 --> 03:09.188
I'm good at babysitting.

03:09.939 --> 03:11.065
I can tutor her too.

03:13.860 --> 03:17.447
You're here to find the drugs, right?
The drug that gives you Mad Human Disease.

03:19.699 --> 03:24.829
Give me that, hide in here and keep quiet.

03:24.913 --> 03:26.706
Then I'll let you live here.

03:26.789 --> 03:28.541
What are you going to do with it?

03:28.625 --> 03:30.919
Your previous plan
to infect everyone failed.

03:32.962 --> 03:35.173
I thought about it,

03:35.256 --> 03:37.800
and my wife came back to life
because she took that drug,

03:37.884 --> 03:39.719
even though her head was crushed.

03:39.802 --> 03:41.763
When I'm in danger,
I'll take that drug too.

03:41.846 --> 03:44.015
Then there's no possibility of dying

03:44.098 --> 03:47.018
from excessive bleeding
after getting bitten by those monsters.

03:48.353 --> 03:50.730
I can get the disease without any pain.

03:50.813 --> 03:53.441
- Aren't you scared of the disease?
- What's so bad about it?

03:55.235 --> 03:57.070
I won't fear anything if I get it.

03:57.946 --> 04:01.407
Mister, this isn't some narcotic.

04:18.508 --> 04:19.926
What were you doing there?

04:20.593 --> 04:22.262
Weren't you on the third floor?

04:22.345 --> 04:25.598
I got permission from the detective
at Unit 501 and moved there.

04:26.432 --> 04:28.643
Is something the matter?

04:30.019 --> 04:32.355
We heard the people
from that house got the disease.

04:33.398 --> 04:36.401
Did they not try to bite you, like this?

04:36.484 --> 04:38.528
No, they didn't.

04:43.116 --> 04:45.827
Honey, did they really get the disease?

04:47.036 --> 04:49.789
You'll be responsible for everything
that happens afterward.

04:51.708 --> 04:55.295
Now, all of you who are here,
let's gather and talk.

04:55.795 --> 05:00.216
We need to discuss
what to do with Unit 501.

05:00.300 --> 05:01.634
Everyone!

05:02.385 --> 05:04.929
Go have a meeting
at the building representative's house.

05:05.013 --> 05:07.473
It's totally empty. There's nothing there!

05:08.057 --> 05:10.601
It'll still have a lot of space
even if everyone here

05:11.728 --> 05:13.396
all goes in there, right?

05:13.980 --> 05:15.481
Detective!

05:17.567 --> 05:20.570
Sae-bom, what's wrong with you?

05:22.238 --> 05:25.908
Sae-bom, take a deep breath and relax.

05:28.661 --> 05:30.121
Goodbye.

05:30.705 --> 05:31.873
Let's go inside.

05:39.630 --> 05:40.465
Sae-bom.

05:43.718 --> 05:44.719
Are you okay?

05:45.928 --> 05:47.013
Aren't you thirsty?

05:47.597 --> 05:49.599
I'm really disappointed in you.

05:58.441 --> 06:01.235
The building representative's house
sounds like a good spot.

06:01.319 --> 06:03.905
And we'll get to see the royal floor too.

06:03.988 --> 06:08.451
Yes, our unit was too shabby
to have valuable guests like you people.

06:09.202 --> 06:11.871
We're not done cleaning the house yet.

06:11.954 --> 06:14.123
That doesn't matter.

06:14.207 --> 06:16.751
The building representative's house
sounds nice.

06:16.834 --> 06:18.086
Let's go, then.

06:18.169 --> 06:19.212
- Let's go.
- Let's go.

06:19.295 --> 06:22.715
Come, let's go.

06:26.177 --> 06:27.261
Are you okay?

06:28.179 --> 06:30.807
Do you think I'd wish
for Sae-bom to get the disease?

06:30.890 --> 06:33.476
I was just worried. You saw it too.
That scar on her hand…

06:33.559 --> 06:36.312
That really is nothing, Jung-kook.
It's just a wound.

06:37.814 --> 06:39.607
You're worrying about nothing.

06:44.112 --> 06:45.530
Yi-hyun, you go inside first.

06:46.072 --> 06:48.574
I'll make sure to guard this place.

06:49.492 --> 06:51.911
When nothing happens
even after a few days,

06:51.994 --> 06:55.123
I'm sure they won't be worried anymore.

06:56.165 --> 06:59.335
Jung-kook, be careful.

07:00.461 --> 07:02.255
You must never trust those people.

07:04.215 --> 07:05.883
This house is really far off.

07:06.884 --> 07:07.969
It really is.

07:08.553 --> 07:09.679
I know, right?

07:10.888 --> 07:12.849
The royal floor has its weaknesses too.

07:12.932 --> 07:16.310
I sacrificed myself
and went down all the time.

07:16.394 --> 07:18.855
Next time, let's just talk down there.

07:20.064 --> 07:24.861
There's nothing here.
Do you really live here?

07:24.944 --> 07:28.865
By the way, this could get you charged
a lot for cleaning.

07:28.948 --> 07:30.950
Why does a pastor drink so much?

07:31.033 --> 07:34.328
More than that,
what should we do with the infected?

07:35.496 --> 07:37.915
You all saw Ms. Yoon's reaction, right?

07:37.999 --> 07:40.376
She can break in anytime at this rate.

07:40.460 --> 07:43.713
Remember what the lawyer said?
Emergency evacuation.

07:44.297 --> 07:46.799
But I don't see him today.

07:47.383 --> 07:49.051
I'll tell you.

07:49.135 --> 07:53.306
It's hard to apply that article
because it's their house,

07:53.389 --> 07:55.600
and the disease did not occur yet.

07:55.683 --> 07:58.186
Right, they didn't cause
any harm or anything.

07:58.269 --> 08:04.275
I have evidence that the female
cop on the fifth floor is infected.

08:05.067 --> 08:08.237
It may be better
to just kick her out of there.

08:08.321 --> 08:10.615
Human beings tend to be strangely brave

08:10.698 --> 08:13.075
when they have nothing
or nobody to back them up.

08:14.577 --> 08:16.829
The disease occurs when they drink water.

08:16.913 --> 08:18.039
The water in that house…

08:18.122 --> 08:20.374
Wouldn't it be more dangerous
if it's there?

08:21.334 --> 08:22.919
Right.

08:23.002 --> 08:26.506
They have a lot of water,
but we can't just throw it away.

08:27.215 --> 08:30.468
The lockdown is getting longer
and everyone must be having difficulties.

08:30.551 --> 08:34.514
So let's share them equally
among all the residents.

08:35.556 --> 08:37.350
Seriously…

08:43.272 --> 08:44.524
They're all so mean.

08:45.566 --> 08:47.777
But they're not bad people.

08:48.528 --> 08:50.363
It's just because they're scared.

08:52.073 --> 08:54.492
- Is the man at Unit 601 scared too?
- Except for him.

08:55.493 --> 08:57.912
Don't go near him, and don't talk to him.

08:57.995 --> 08:59.539
Treat him like he doesn't exist.

08:59.622 --> 09:01.040
- Don't even look at him.
- Right.

09:01.123 --> 09:03.417
But how can Mr. Kim do that to us?

09:03.501 --> 09:06.295
We've known each other
for more than ten years.

09:07.713 --> 09:09.549
I'm not trying to defend him,

09:09.632 --> 09:11.926
but he has been away from home
for a long time now.

09:12.009 --> 09:15.012
He must be worried and
miss his wife very much.

09:15.096 --> 09:17.098
You know I score people, right?

09:17.181 --> 09:18.683
Points for doing good things,

09:18.766 --> 09:20.434
and deductions for doing bad things.

09:22.270 --> 09:24.564
Mr. Kim has reached minus now.

09:24.647 --> 09:27.483
Give some of my points to him.
I'm sure I have a lot of points.

09:29.068 --> 09:30.236
I'm above zero, right?

09:48.629 --> 09:50.131
The detective went up.

09:50.715 --> 09:52.008
Went up to where?

09:52.091 --> 09:54.802
People are upstairs,
planning to kick you two out.

09:55.595 --> 09:57.179
I told him that, and he went up.

10:02.727 --> 10:04.103
Kick us out to where?

10:04.687 --> 10:07.607
Outside. They're also planning
to take your water and food.

10:14.196 --> 10:15.489
Stay here with Seo-yoon.

10:16.157 --> 10:17.116
Sae-bom!

10:17.199 --> 10:19.035
Yoon Sae-bom! Stay calm!

10:21.245 --> 10:22.330
Are you worried?

10:24.165 --> 10:25.458
Not about Sae-bom…

10:26.626 --> 10:27.668
but about the others.

10:32.256 --> 10:34.675
She's a public official,
so if she bites someone,

10:34.759 --> 10:37.011
she'll lose her house.
You all know it, don't you?

10:37.094 --> 10:39.847
Sae-bom was so happy to live
in an apartment!

10:39.930 --> 10:42.558
You live in the same apartment.
Why are you doing this?

10:45.561 --> 10:48.147
Sae-bom, why are you here?

10:48.230 --> 10:50.650
I'll explain everything,
so you go home first.

10:50.733 --> 10:53.402
Detective, what are you doing?
She's holding a knife!

10:56.030 --> 10:57.823
What were you all talking about?

11:10.628 --> 11:14.465
What? Are you going to shoot?
And kill us all?

11:14.548 --> 11:17.385
Hey, Sae-bom. Calm down.

11:18.094 --> 11:19.678
It's okay, just let her be!

11:19.762 --> 11:22.098
She doesn't even have the guts to shoot!
Go ahead and shoot!

11:41.700 --> 11:43.536
Police officers always
leave the first round empty.

11:46.622 --> 11:48.332
Now what are you going to do?

11:48.416 --> 11:52.253
Are you going to scare us
and live here, infected?

11:53.671 --> 11:55.381
I just came here because I got angry.

11:56.924 --> 12:02.721
Since we're all here anyway,
should we look for the infected?

12:05.099 --> 12:06.225
Is there a way?

12:07.935 --> 12:10.896
I'm sure you all know
that the infected feel thirsty.

12:10.980 --> 12:13.065
So what would happen
if they see human blood

12:13.149 --> 12:15.651
after holding it in
and hiding their thirst?

12:15.734 --> 12:16.902
Where's the blood?

12:19.864 --> 12:20.739
Here.

12:36.755 --> 12:38.174
Darn it.

12:39.425 --> 12:40.384
It's okay.

13:59.880 --> 14:01.298
She quieted down a moment ago.

14:02.800 --> 14:04.718
What should we do now?

14:04.802 --> 14:06.011
We must wait for now,

14:06.720 --> 14:08.514
until she's able to communicate.

14:11.058 --> 14:14.520
Since Mr. Kim is here,
let's go up and get you treated.

14:17.523 --> 14:20.109
The smell of blood will only
make it harder for Bo-ram.

14:22.903 --> 14:24.363
You stay here.

14:33.163 --> 14:35.708
We have to find out
if she got bitten or took drugs.

14:35.791 --> 14:38.085
Okay, I'll ask her later.

14:39.461 --> 14:40.296
Hey.

14:43.340 --> 14:47.094
Let's hurry. It'll be serious
if you get a bacterial infection.

14:47.177 --> 14:48.637
Calm down, okay?

14:48.721 --> 14:50.848
I have a strong immune system.

14:52.558 --> 14:56.520
Ms. Lee is moving.

14:58.314 --> 15:00.524
I'll go up alone,
so you go ahead in there.

15:01.525 --> 15:03.861
I know how to do simple first aid.

15:03.944 --> 15:05.487
I just need to stop the bleeding.

15:06.739 --> 15:09.366
Put ointment on,
and cover it with a new towel.

15:10.034 --> 15:11.285
Put your hand up high,

15:12.369 --> 15:14.038
and lie down.

15:31.055 --> 15:32.640
Give me some water too, please.

15:32.723 --> 15:34.141
That scared the crap out of me.

15:34.892 --> 15:36.602
This isn't yours!

15:42.358 --> 15:43.651
All of you should go now.

15:44.526 --> 15:46.987
This is not the right time
for a discussion.

15:51.075 --> 15:52.660
Honey, let's go.

16:00.042 --> 16:01.335
You're all still here.

16:01.418 --> 16:02.670
What is it now?

16:03.545 --> 16:06.882
You can't just go.
Sae-bom went through all that trouble.

16:06.966 --> 16:07.841
Gosh.

16:07.925 --> 16:09.969
We must find everyone infected
until the end.

16:10.052 --> 16:12.680
Mr. Oh, we don't know
if you're infected, either.

16:13.305 --> 16:14.598
Don't you think so?

16:17.685 --> 16:19.520
You too, building representative.

16:28.696 --> 16:29.613
I'm going in.

16:34.284 --> 16:35.536
You should get out now.

16:36.370 --> 16:38.205
I might change again soon.

16:38.288 --> 16:43.419
Don't worry. You came back to normal,
so it won't happen again for a while.

16:48.340 --> 16:50.342
I'm here to talk
about something important.

16:51.677 --> 16:55.014
We must find out where you got infected.

16:55.097 --> 16:57.516
We need to be prepared.

16:59.685 --> 17:00.644
Did you…

17:02.479 --> 17:05.065
get drugs from the gym, by any chance?

17:07.109 --> 17:09.236
I got infected at the supermarket.

17:09.319 --> 17:14.199
I think I got my leg scratched
when I hid from the infected.

17:23.667 --> 17:30.090
I was scared that they wouldn't
let me into the apartment if I told them.

17:30.841 --> 17:34.595
No one's going to come here,
so get some rest.

17:37.431 --> 17:38.849
Thank you.

17:40.601 --> 17:41.643
If it wasn't for you,

17:42.895 --> 17:44.646
I would have bitten someone.

17:45.814 --> 17:47.024
You don't know that.

17:49.401 --> 17:53.447
Perhaps you would've been able
to hold it in, without biting anyone.

17:57.701 --> 18:00.913
Did you throw away a bloody towel
by the emergency stairs?

18:00.996 --> 18:02.164
In a trash bag?

18:03.415 --> 18:06.251
No, that wasn't me.

18:17.513 --> 18:18.889
Why? Is something out there?

18:20.599 --> 18:22.059
I hear something from outside.

18:23.560 --> 18:24.812
From the golf course.

18:28.440 --> 18:31.735
Isn't Mr. Na there?

18:42.913 --> 18:43.747
You…

18:44.873 --> 18:49.044
just need to say the woman
on the fifth floor seems infected.

18:52.172 --> 18:53.298
What?

18:53.382 --> 18:56.176
I think I heard something from over there.

18:56.260 --> 18:59.096
No one would come down
when there's an infected here.

19:06.228 --> 19:09.314
Do you play golf?

19:09.398 --> 19:11.358
Just screen golf, occasionally.

19:12.693 --> 19:15.237
Then you can practice comfortably here.

19:15.320 --> 19:17.906
You get out as a single player.

19:27.875 --> 19:32.337
When the cure is out,
you should get a shot and go home safely.

19:32.421 --> 19:36.717
Your family won't like it if they find out
that you got Mad Human Disease.

19:38.427 --> 19:40.762
Is it because of the woman
on the fifth floor?

19:40.846 --> 19:43.515
Because she's in the SOU?

19:44.683 --> 19:47.686
I was in the military too. The KATUSA.

19:48.270 --> 19:51.356
And I was in
the National Guard in Kentucky.

19:51.440 --> 19:56.195
I could tell straight away. She's nothing.

19:56.278 --> 19:57.362
Are you sure?

19:59.489 --> 20:01.366
Are you sure you were in the army?

20:02.367 --> 20:03.994
I was a military chaplain.

20:05.454 --> 20:08.999
You should go home now.
I'm sure your wife is quite shocked.

20:17.049 --> 20:18.967
Leave the golf club here.

20:28.602 --> 20:31.647
When you go downstairs,
explain the situation to others,

20:31.730 --> 20:33.273
and be careful of each other.

20:33.357 --> 20:35.776
- And always meet in groups.
- Okay.

20:39.238 --> 20:40.781
You've done so much.

20:44.451 --> 20:47.663
You should be careful
not to get infected too.

20:47.746 --> 20:50.874
Don't worry. I'm always careful.

20:50.958 --> 20:53.252
Change your pants when you get home.

20:53.335 --> 20:54.586
I think they're wet.

20:57.714 --> 20:59.633
Please go so I can be alone.

21:00.592 --> 21:02.970
You should stay home for a while too.

21:03.053 --> 21:04.805
It might have an incubation period.

21:34.042 --> 21:35.043
Honey.

21:35.961 --> 21:37.921
What's going on?

22:26.428 --> 22:28.764
- What are you doing?
- I saw blood.

22:28.847 --> 22:31.433
The couple from the fifth floor
did something crazy again.

22:33.351 --> 22:35.145
I need to gather the residents again.

22:35.729 --> 22:40.108
This time, we will get rid
of the infected inside for good.

22:52.662 --> 22:53.789
Where have you been?

22:55.332 --> 22:57.542
You said you'd stay home.

22:58.460 --> 23:01.755
I did. With my hand up, and lying in bed.

23:05.133 --> 23:08.804
But I got a better idea on my way up.

23:13.934 --> 23:16.061
Let's see how much better that idea was.

23:18.396 --> 23:19.773
Listen, okay?

23:19.856 --> 23:21.525
Since I bled anyway,

23:21.608 --> 23:24.277
I thought it'd be better
to find more infected people…

23:26.738 --> 23:28.949
So did you find them? The infected?

23:31.701 --> 23:32.577
No.

23:33.870 --> 23:35.163
I mean, that's a good thing…

23:39.417 --> 23:40.585
But this is not good.

23:42.045 --> 23:44.005
You can put ointment on it.

23:44.089 --> 23:45.340
It will heal soon.

23:46.174 --> 23:47.092
Let's go inside.

23:53.765 --> 23:54.975
What are you doing there?

24:01.064 --> 24:03.275
I was too ashamed to see you guys.

24:03.775 --> 24:07.070
I was gullible,
so I just caused trouble for you…

24:07.571 --> 24:10.073
I'll just stay on the second floor
or in the gym.

24:11.741 --> 24:13.910
I can't face Seo-yoon, either.

24:14.494 --> 24:16.580
Forget it. Hurry up and come inside.

24:16.663 --> 24:18.290
We have to treat Yi-hyun's wound.

24:21.960 --> 24:23.170
Mr. Kim.

24:25.839 --> 24:27.132
Cheer up.

24:27.924 --> 24:30.093
From now on,
tell us if you have any concerns.

24:34.806 --> 24:36.308
Don't betray us.

24:37.267 --> 24:38.268
That was…

24:38.768 --> 24:41.438
That was my first time betraying anyone.

24:42.105 --> 24:42.939
Jeez.

24:49.362 --> 24:50.614
- Let's go inside.
- Right.

24:51.740 --> 24:52.741
Thanks.

24:54.659 --> 24:55.535
Hey.

24:56.328 --> 24:59.831
I promise to live a good life.

25:05.587 --> 25:08.006
Come on, let's go inside.

25:17.265 --> 25:19.351
Mister, are you badly hurt?

25:19.434 --> 25:21.228
No, it's just a scratch.

25:22.562 --> 25:24.105
Not by the infected. By a knife.

25:25.565 --> 25:27.734
- Hey…
- I just cut myself.

25:27.817 --> 25:31.613
Seo-yoon, he needs to be treated,
so let's wait outside.

25:31.696 --> 25:32.864
- I harmed myself…
- Hey.

25:34.908 --> 25:35.992
Sit here.

25:45.377 --> 25:48.630
How could you suddenly cause such trouble

25:50.173 --> 25:52.008
when you seemed totally fine?

25:53.426 --> 25:54.636
What could I have done?

25:54.719 --> 25:56.346
Just watch you do it yourself

25:56.429 --> 25:58.598
and compliment you
for making a nice, clean cut?

25:58.682 --> 26:00.433
You and I are not the same.

26:02.185 --> 26:04.437
I would've made a small cut,
for just a few drops.

26:05.272 --> 26:08.191
You only needed to scare them,
not cover the place with your blood.

26:08.275 --> 26:10.318
It's because I'm passionate.

26:10.402 --> 26:14.155
I only bled a bit.
My blood vessels are all fine, look.

26:14.864 --> 26:16.366
Do I look that dumb?

26:30.547 --> 26:32.507
See? It's fine.

26:36.303 --> 26:37.262
It's not?

26:39.723 --> 26:41.391
Will my hand be damaged forever?

26:47.230 --> 26:48.940
It won't need stitches.

26:50.984 --> 26:51.860
Okay.

26:53.153 --> 26:54.529
Don't do this next time.

26:54.612 --> 26:56.364
I feel sick seeing you hurt.

26:56.448 --> 26:58.366
My stomach doesn't feel good.

26:59.367 --> 27:00.952
I don't think I can eat dinner.

27:01.036 --> 27:02.370
Same for me.

27:03.788 --> 27:06.291
All those people were staring at you

27:06.374 --> 27:08.543
and you held up a knife,
trying to cut yourself.

27:08.626 --> 27:11.171
- So how could I just stand there?
- Then what about me?

27:12.130 --> 27:14.507
It's okay for me to do this,
but you shouldn't do it.

27:14.591 --> 27:17.135
- Why?
- Just don't do it when I say so.

27:21.765 --> 27:23.099
Don't overreact.

27:36.821 --> 27:38.698
She's infected. Why is she still there?

27:38.782 --> 27:39.949
Be quiet.

27:40.033 --> 27:42.660
You said that she is infected.

27:44.496 --> 27:46.206
Is she really tied up?

27:47.707 --> 27:49.167
Can you move aside?

28:01.096 --> 28:04.516
I'll take her, so you wrap up
the situation here.

28:25.370 --> 28:26.704
Damn it.

28:28.123 --> 28:30.708
Where do you want to go?
There's space in the golf course.

28:31.251 --> 28:34.587
I feel stuffy.
I'd like to go to an open place.

28:35.797 --> 28:36.965
Okay.

28:46.433 --> 28:48.351
Everyone who can come is all here.

28:48.435 --> 28:49.978
The 15th floor guy never joins us,

28:50.061 --> 28:53.481
and the family on the third floor
said they'll just stay home.

28:53.565 --> 28:55.233
The pastor isn't here.

28:56.067 --> 28:57.819
He said he's not feeling well.

28:57.902 --> 29:00.947
- Make sure to check if he's infected too.
- What did you say?

29:02.615 --> 29:04.492
Please calm down.

29:04.993 --> 29:07.912
The cleaning lady isn't here, either.
By any chance…

29:08.496 --> 29:09.664
Is she at your house?

29:09.748 --> 29:11.666
No, she isn't at our house.

29:11.750 --> 29:13.126
Didn't she go to the basement?

29:13.209 --> 29:15.044
There's an employee lounge there.

29:15.128 --> 29:17.338
Let's not drag this and find the infected.

29:17.422 --> 29:19.799
You said they go insane
when they see blood.

29:24.012 --> 29:25.472
I am not infected. I'm serious.

29:26.014 --> 29:28.516
Detective, please speed it up…

29:30.435 --> 29:32.061
- Get me a cup.
- Okay.

29:32.896 --> 29:34.022
Well then…

29:35.523 --> 29:40.445
Mr. Lawyer, you can do this yourself.
We have a knife too.

29:41.905 --> 29:44.115
Fill half the cup,
like during a urine test.

29:45.366 --> 29:48.495
Come on, that's what
a police officer should do.

29:48.578 --> 29:51.080
You're already wounded too.

29:51.164 --> 29:52.540
Yes, he's right.

29:52.624 --> 29:54.626
You want me to open my wound again?

29:55.251 --> 29:57.045
The police are not blood donors.

29:57.128 --> 29:59.005
Anyone who wants to do it can do it.

30:04.511 --> 30:05.386
No one?

30:19.150 --> 30:20.276
Would this be enough?

30:24.239 --> 30:25.114
Stop the bleeding.

30:26.783 --> 30:28.243
Do you all feel relieved now?

30:30.411 --> 30:31.579
Here.

30:34.165 --> 30:36.000
If there's anyone infected here…

30:38.336 --> 30:40.171
there may be a sign, don't you think?

30:54.060 --> 30:55.687
Seriously…

30:56.271 --> 30:57.230
Come here.

30:59.941 --> 31:01.067
Be careful.

31:02.610 --> 31:03.736
Look at it straight.

31:05.864 --> 31:08.408
- Are you okay?
- Yes.

31:10.034 --> 31:13.621
So, none of us here are infected, right?

31:15.164 --> 31:16.040
Right.

31:16.875 --> 31:19.544
Now then, let's discuss food.

31:19.627 --> 31:22.338
I heard you people
are trying to make a killing.

31:22.422 --> 31:24.507
You were demanding ridiculous
amounts of money.

31:24.591 --> 31:25.925
What do you mean, ridiculous?

31:26.009 --> 31:27.677
Demand and supply. Capitalism.

31:27.760 --> 31:31.306
You live in such fancy apartments,
and you can't even pay that much?

31:31.389 --> 31:34.267
You're being rude.
Why are you talking down to us?

31:34.893 --> 31:36.394
I didn't talk rudely!

31:36.477 --> 31:38.563
You just talked rudely, again!

31:39.230 --> 31:41.274
And what do you know about capitalism?

31:42.191 --> 31:43.026
WONJUNG DORMITORY

31:43.109 --> 31:45.862
A new variant has been confirmed
among severe patients.

31:45.945 --> 31:46.946
How is it different?

31:47.030 --> 31:49.741
It can control the timing
of the occurrence.

31:49.824 --> 31:51.743
It suppresses the thirst most of the time,

31:51.826 --> 31:55.246
and it occurs only when it's convinced
that it won't get caught.

31:56.623 --> 31:58.333
This disease is as cunning as humans.

31:59.709 --> 32:02.587
The authorities want follow-up measures,

32:02.670 --> 32:05.548
but it's difficult to secure those
infected with the variant.

32:06.591 --> 32:08.051
How's his current condition?

32:08.885 --> 32:11.012
We injected a tranquilizer cocktail.

32:11.804 --> 32:14.515
It would keep him in
a normal state for ten minutes,

32:14.599 --> 32:18.645
but he has a high chance of
being unable to recover ever again.

32:18.728 --> 32:20.229
Ten minutes would be enough.

32:28.321 --> 32:29.530
How have you been?

32:32.367 --> 32:35.411
I'm a bit late. I had a lot
of work to do because of you.

32:37.664 --> 32:41.084
The funeral went well.

32:44.087 --> 32:47.298
Some cried when they heard
you volunteered for the clinical test.

32:49.300 --> 32:53.930
When everything's over, you might
receive a Medal of National Merit.

32:55.807 --> 32:57.600
Your children were crying a lot.

32:59.185 --> 33:02.480
You didn't tell them the account number
for your slush fund, did you?

33:02.563 --> 33:04.482
Do you think it'll end like this?

33:04.565 --> 33:07.527
Of course, it won't.
We still have a lot of tests to conduct.

33:07.610 --> 33:08.861
The authorities…

33:10.071 --> 33:13.616
are all getting you to make
the dirty decisions, aren't they?

33:14.367 --> 33:18.204
Do you think you'll become someone big
if you hold out until the cure is out?

33:19.706 --> 33:21.165
That won't happen.

33:21.249 --> 33:25.503
Once the hunt is over,
the hounds become useless.

33:29.215 --> 33:31.134
Your wife, your kid…

33:33.845 --> 33:36.055
They will all become like me.

33:43.730 --> 33:45.314
You have five minutes left

33:45.398 --> 33:47.567
to speak with sanity.

33:49.402 --> 33:50.361
The hound…

33:54.574 --> 33:56.701
If I secure the cure…

33:57.535 --> 33:59.871
who do you think
would be treated as the hound?

34:03.791 --> 34:05.460
What about Ms. Yoon's blood analysis?

34:05.543 --> 34:08.087
The result will be out tomorrow
at the earliest.

34:08.171 --> 34:10.173
You need severe patients with the variant?

34:10.256 --> 34:11.090
Yes.

34:11.174 --> 34:14.886
They hide their thirst well,
and we can't tell just by looking.

34:15.762 --> 34:18.139
And we can't neglect
those who are already infected

34:18.222 --> 34:19.599
until they get the variant.

34:20.600 --> 34:22.018
Seyang Forest.

34:24.228 --> 34:27.815
A lot of severe patients are there.

34:32.195 --> 34:34.363
It's been ten days since the lockdown.

34:34.447 --> 34:36.866
That means there might have been
enough mutations.

34:40.661 --> 34:42.580
Is that why you insisted on the lockdown?

34:44.290 --> 34:46.125
To track down the mutation of the virus?

34:46.209 --> 34:49.295
We have to find out
how the virus mutates in a natural state.

34:49.879 --> 34:53.341
So it's like a petri dish
containing a collection of germs.

34:54.801 --> 34:57.637
And you must've thought
that an antibody may have formed,

34:57.720 --> 34:58.930
if you were lucky.

35:00.723 --> 35:03.684
Make a small opening,
just enough for one person to squeeze out.

35:03.768 --> 35:05.937
Then the infected
will come out on their own,

35:06.020 --> 35:07.480
so catch and study them.

35:22.620 --> 35:25.706
Did you tell your husband
before you came here?

35:27.583 --> 35:29.043
I have a favor to ask.

35:29.794 --> 35:34.215
Do you have items needed
for outdoor survival?

35:34.298 --> 35:37.385
And can you please give me
some water and food too?

35:37.468 --> 35:41.722
It's not for me.
There's someone on the rooftop.

35:46.269 --> 35:48.020
Stay here for a while.

35:48.104 --> 35:50.022
I'll keep all the doors blocked.

35:50.606 --> 35:52.275
Thank you so much.

35:52.358 --> 35:55.361
I brought some water and food.

35:58.281 --> 36:00.575
I'll go get some more from my house.

36:00.658 --> 36:02.451
Please don't bring any water.

36:02.535 --> 36:04.704
The more I drink it, the thirstier I get.

36:04.787 --> 36:07.165
It's better to just wet my lips a bit.

36:08.958 --> 36:10.042
The cooler…

36:10.877 --> 36:12.795
You didn't drink water then, right?

36:18.885 --> 36:19.719
I didn't.

36:19.802 --> 36:23.681
Who else didn't drink water there?

36:25.683 --> 36:28.019
I only put a small amount of water in it.

36:28.102 --> 36:31.647
Drink the water in small amounts,
and tell me if you feel thirsty.

36:38.863 --> 36:40.323
I'll untie you while you eat…

36:40.406 --> 36:41.782
Don't come near me.

36:45.703 --> 36:49.624
When someone gets closer,
my thirst gets worse.

36:50.333 --> 36:53.294
I'm okay. I'll just eat like this.

36:58.132 --> 37:00.176
Were you okay yesterday?

37:00.259 --> 37:03.012
I heard the pastor on
the 12th floor came here.

37:03.095 --> 37:04.972
Didn't you have a long talk with him?

37:06.432 --> 37:07.475
But…

37:09.018 --> 37:11.979
I didn't want to attack him.

37:14.106 --> 37:16.150
Looks like the disease
is choosy about people.

37:17.026 --> 37:19.779
Even mosquitoes bite
only one person out of many people.

37:20.279 --> 37:24.242
Jung-kook, you said that the infected
did not attack the pastor?

37:25.534 --> 37:27.870
He's very religious.

37:28.663 --> 37:29.872
He has spiritual powers.

37:37.129 --> 37:39.173
Our Father in heaven,

37:40.049 --> 37:42.468
hallowed be your name,

37:43.427 --> 37:44.971
your kingdom come,

37:48.683 --> 37:52.228
your will be done,
on earth as it is in heaven.

37:52.895 --> 37:56.607
Give us today our daily bread,

37:57.358 --> 38:00.611
daily bread, daily…

38:54.707 --> 38:56.500
You still haven't cleaned the blood?

38:58.794 --> 39:00.880
Did you find any other infected?

39:00.963 --> 39:01.922
Not yet.

39:02.673 --> 39:05.676
I need to go to the 3rd floor
and the 15th floor too.

39:06.385 --> 39:07.970
It'll be nice to say

39:08.054 --> 39:10.473
that I protected the apartment,
don't you think?

39:17.146 --> 39:20.983
It's blood. We need something
to catch the infected with.

39:21.734 --> 39:25.237
It's from that guy on the second floor
who keeps his face covered,

39:25.321 --> 39:27.198
but he's weird too.

39:34.163 --> 39:35.539
Bite me if you want to.

39:37.124 --> 39:38.376
What?

39:39.585 --> 39:41.754
I said, did I lose my hair?

39:41.837 --> 39:43.005
A little bit.

39:44.298 --> 39:45.424
What?

39:46.425 --> 39:47.510
Really?

39:48.636 --> 39:49.845
Darn it!

40:10.074 --> 40:12.076
Where am I missing my hair the most?

40:12.159 --> 40:14.036
No, I think you're fine.

40:20.793 --> 40:21.627
Hey.

40:21.710 --> 40:23.045
How's Bo-ram?

40:23.129 --> 40:24.171
She's fine.

40:24.255 --> 40:27.091
More than that, the water from the cooler…

40:27.174 --> 40:28.259
Yes?

40:28.342 --> 40:29.885
The pastor didn't drink it.

40:29.969 --> 40:31.512
I thought of that too.

40:31.595 --> 40:33.556
The infected didn't bite the pastor.

40:33.639 --> 40:35.683
Right? It's a cult.

40:35.766 --> 40:37.935
- Isn't it weird?
- Let's go and check.

40:38.018 --> 40:39.979
The purpose of the virus
is to spread the disease.

40:40.062 --> 40:42.731
So they stop drinking blood
when the victim is infected.

40:42.815 --> 40:45.568
Would the infected bite each other
when they're together?

40:46.318 --> 40:47.570
- They wouldn't.
- Right?

40:47.653 --> 40:50.197
It makes sense to not feel
the thirst for each other.

40:50.281 --> 40:51.782
Then the pastor is also…

40:53.993 --> 40:55.244
We have to go check.

41:10.926 --> 41:13.429
This is just a misunderstanding.

41:13.512 --> 41:15.848
Yeon-ok, let's…

41:17.850 --> 41:19.852
Let's talk face to face, okay?

41:21.061 --> 41:23.105
Why would I do that, you jerk?

41:23.981 --> 41:25.858
When did you get infected?

41:26.775 --> 41:28.986
Seung-beom gave me drugs.

41:30.779 --> 41:33.157
There must have been something in them.

41:33.240 --> 41:36.243
Then you should've told me!

41:37.953 --> 41:40.623
If I told you,
you wouldn't have forgiven me!

41:42.041 --> 41:43.918
I tried to hold it in too.

41:45.669 --> 41:47.796
I tried drinking my own blood,

41:48.964 --> 41:50.549
but it's no use.

42:01.060 --> 42:02.478
The thirst only gets worse.

42:04.230 --> 42:06.357
This is hard for me too!

42:07.066 --> 42:10.736
Should I just go down to the gym?

42:18.244 --> 42:21.705
Woo-chang, it's been so hard for us.

42:22.915 --> 42:24.583
If they find out about your disease,

42:24.667 --> 42:27.253
I won't be able to become
the resident representative.

42:27.336 --> 42:29.380
We can't just give up like this!

42:29.463 --> 42:31.382
Then what should we do?

42:32.675 --> 42:35.970
If you stay in your room,
I will give you food.

42:36.971 --> 42:37.930
Okay?

42:39.056 --> 42:40.808
Let's just tell them that you're sick.

42:40.891 --> 42:43.269
If you wait for a few days,
the soldiers will come.

42:43.352 --> 42:45.563
Just hang in there. Can you do that?

42:48.232 --> 42:49.149
Honey.

42:49.900 --> 42:51.026
Woo-chang?

42:53.946 --> 42:55.155
Woo-chang!

43:16.677 --> 43:17.970
Anybody home?

43:22.933 --> 43:24.602
Should we break the door?

43:24.685 --> 43:26.812
Hey, calm down.

43:28.063 --> 43:30.024
You should be the one calming me down.

43:30.107 --> 43:31.900
Sometimes we need to switch our roles.

43:33.068 --> 43:34.361
Building representative!

43:45.331 --> 43:46.790
Is the pastor home?

43:48.125 --> 43:48.959
No.

43:50.002 --> 43:51.170
He went outside.

43:54.381 --> 43:55.841
Are you sure he's not home?

44:26.955 --> 44:29.375
Pastor, I'd like to pray.

44:49.061 --> 44:51.063
What are you doing here?

45:02.699 --> 45:04.410
We had a few more things to discuss.

45:04.493 --> 45:06.745
And the weather is hot…

45:33.814 --> 45:35.899
The pastor…

45:44.533 --> 45:45.659
Hey!

45:50.456 --> 45:52.082
Doesn't this look more delicious?

46:45.802 --> 46:48.013
Looks like it needs ointment again.

46:50.015 --> 46:50.933
Let's go.

47:08.116 --> 47:11.411
Once they smell blood,
their symptoms get worse.

47:11.995 --> 47:13.789
Go in there when he calms down.

47:15.541 --> 47:19.002
Did your thoughts
on the infected change now?

49:07.861 --> 49:09.780
You killed him.

49:13.408 --> 49:14.868
You did…

50:13.385 --> 50:15.011
Have you been here this whole time?

50:17.139 --> 50:19.516
It seemed like the infected were outside.

50:20.142 --> 50:22.644
Did you take care of it?

50:45.959 --> 50:49.921
You were scared, weren't you?
I should've protected you…

50:50.797 --> 50:54.217
I know you're going to do that
from now on. I trust you.

50:55.260 --> 50:58.764
Oh Joo-hyung was with the pastor.
He might've been infected.

50:59.806 --> 51:01.349
Then what should I do?

51:01.433 --> 51:03.226
I can't stay at your house, either.

51:04.978 --> 51:06.980
I'll talk to my wife about it--

51:07.063 --> 51:08.231
No.

51:09.065 --> 51:11.026
She'll find out about our relationship.

51:11.109 --> 51:12.527
But still…

51:15.030 --> 51:17.407
I told you.
Oh Joo-hyung's bankruptcy is fake.

51:17.908 --> 51:19.785
He invested everything in cryptocurrency.

51:19.868 --> 51:23.038
Once we know the passcode to
his account, it'll all be ours.

51:26.958 --> 51:27.876
Okay?

51:42.307 --> 51:43.350
Where have you been?

51:44.142 --> 51:46.102
Did you hear the man
on the 12th floor died?

51:46.186 --> 51:50.273
Yes, I was pretty shocked,
so I went to the rooftop to get some air.

51:50.357 --> 51:53.485
The rooftop? But Ms. Lee is there.

51:53.568 --> 51:58.657
She is, I just sat in front of the door.
I was so shocked, you know.

51:58.740 --> 52:02.410
The man's eyes turned all white, and…

52:03.495 --> 52:04.996
You should've seen it.

52:06.414 --> 52:12.879
By the way, let's say that you have
a very important passcode.

52:12.963 --> 52:15.006
Something very long and complex,

52:15.090 --> 52:17.342
something no one should find out.

52:17.425 --> 52:18.885
Where would you hide it?

52:20.095 --> 52:21.054
I should memorize it.

52:21.137 --> 52:23.849
Or write it somewhere
the others don't know about,

52:24.599 --> 52:25.684
so only I'd know.

52:59.134 --> 53:01.595
Are you thirsty?
You're not feeling sick, are you?

53:02.637 --> 53:04.556
You washed your hair
when we have no water?

53:04.639 --> 53:06.850
I couldn't help it.
It was itchy and greasy.

53:06.933 --> 53:08.018
And don't worry.

53:08.101 --> 53:09.895
We'll have a source of water soon.

53:22.532 --> 53:24.534
Don't ever do this again.

53:24.618 --> 53:26.745
We don't even have antibiotics.

53:26.828 --> 53:29.497
I'm a human vitamin
and a human antibiotic.

53:29.581 --> 53:30.874
I'm totally fine.

53:40.884 --> 53:42.302
The pastor from the 12th floor…

53:43.595 --> 53:45.096
It wasn't our fault.

53:45.680 --> 53:46.640
I know.

53:49.434 --> 53:50.685
I still feel bad.

53:52.312 --> 53:54.439
He should've told us that he was sick.

53:56.900 --> 53:59.319
It's hard to confess
to being infected by the disease.

54:00.445 --> 54:03.740
And they'd be scared
about wanting to bite the others.

54:06.076 --> 54:11.706
And they might think they could
get the cure if they just hold out.

54:13.500 --> 54:15.210
And it would also hurt…

54:16.586 --> 54:19.923
to think someone they care about
might get scared of them.

54:25.720 --> 54:27.931
Why? Do I have a fever?

54:29.599 --> 54:30.684
I have a fever.

54:32.477 --> 54:33.895
You have fever medicine, right?

54:34.562 --> 54:38.066
I'll take that just in case,
and let's rest tomorrow.

54:38.149 --> 54:39.150
And not do anything.

54:40.235 --> 54:41.152
Good night.

54:42.112 --> 54:42.988
Good night.

54:46.658 --> 54:47.575
Am I okay?

54:50.870 --> 54:51.913
Go to sleep.

56:15.330 --> 56:16.247
Honey.

56:53.118 --> 56:56.162
We had no idea.
How could they have done this?

56:56.246 --> 56:58.957
I heard the pastor
on the 12th floor was infected.

56:59.040 --> 57:02.085
He passed away.
Please wish for him to rest in peace.

57:02.168 --> 57:04.420
Unbelievable.
That couple tricked all of us.

57:04.504 --> 57:07.090
I think you two should restore
order around here.

57:07.173 --> 57:08.508
Did you come here to say that?

57:08.591 --> 57:10.677
That, and we're here for water too.

57:10.760 --> 57:13.930
You know everyone's short on water, right?

57:14.013 --> 57:16.266
We saw that you had a lot
of water in your house.

57:16.933 --> 57:18.184
You want some of our water?

57:18.268 --> 57:20.603
- Yes.
- You and the 15th floor.

57:21.187 --> 57:22.814
The others went to the 15th floor.

57:24.149 --> 57:26.651
I went to the rooftop,
and the supermarket lady said

57:26.734 --> 57:29.195
she's not going to drink water,
and she gave us this.

57:29.279 --> 57:31.281
You didn't mess with Ms. Lee, did you?

57:32.073 --> 57:34.534
Goodness, why would we mess with her?

57:34.617 --> 57:36.161
The infected are scary, you know.

57:37.162 --> 57:41.040
This is the water
from the 15th floor, right?

57:41.124 --> 57:43.209
That guy has a lot of water
at home, right?

57:45.420 --> 57:46.796
He does.

57:47.380 --> 57:48.882
Right, we should go there first.

57:48.965 --> 57:50.675
We should've gone there first.

57:56.973 --> 57:58.183
When is it going to rain?

57:58.266 --> 57:59.100
What?

58:00.018 --> 58:01.019
I feel nothing.

58:03.646 --> 58:04.689
By the way…

58:05.940 --> 58:07.901
should we give out our water too?

58:09.819 --> 58:11.404
We're fine, but Seo-yoon…

58:12.405 --> 58:13.823
More than that, the 15th floor…

58:14.365 --> 58:16.493
People went to the 15th floor.

58:16.576 --> 58:20.622
Excuse me, please open the door. We…

58:22.457 --> 58:23.875
What is it?

58:23.958 --> 58:26.753
You have a lot of water, right?
Everyone's having a hard time.

58:26.836 --> 58:27.795
Share some with us.

58:27.879 --> 58:30.048
The lockdown will be over
in a few days, anyway.

58:30.131 --> 58:31.049
What if it doesn't?

58:31.132 --> 58:32.800
I'll pay you, so share some.

58:32.884 --> 58:36.429
These cleaners sell water
for 200,000 won per 500ml.

58:36.513 --> 58:38.681
That's even more expensive than oil.

58:38.765 --> 58:40.850
If you think it's unfair, you do it too.

58:40.934 --> 58:43.186
Excuse me, we'll talk to him.

58:43.269 --> 58:44.354
- You should go.
- But…

58:44.437 --> 58:48.149
- Doing this won't solve anything.
- The residents should get along.

58:48.233 --> 58:50.610
- You might need legal consulting someday!
- Hi.

58:50.693 --> 58:52.779
You know the doctor
has a dirty temper, right?

58:52.862 --> 58:55.073
- He may set this place on fire.
- Don't say that!

58:55.156 --> 58:57.242
- I get it, so…
- Let's talk for a minute.

59:08.253 --> 59:09.295
Go ahead.

59:11.339 --> 59:12.423
I'm sorry.

59:13.424 --> 59:15.969
I asked you for all sorts of things…

59:16.052 --> 59:17.387
With what's going on,

59:17.470 --> 59:20.181
how about sharing some water
if you have a lot left?

59:20.265 --> 59:22.892
You'd only have to share
a little bit of it.

59:25.562 --> 59:28.731
You don't have to do it,
but please think about it.

59:29.566 --> 59:32.735
If things really get hard,
we'll go outside and get some.

59:32.819 --> 59:34.571
You don't need to go outside.

59:35.738 --> 59:36.906
Building 103 has EPS…

59:38.741 --> 59:40.952
Emergency Power Supply,
in the electrical room

59:41.035 --> 59:42.579
under the senior citizens' center.

59:42.662 --> 59:45.498
It's made to turn on
emergency lights for elevators.

59:45.582 --> 59:47.458
If you turn on the general power,

59:48.167 --> 59:50.295
the electricity and water
will be turned on.

59:50.378 --> 59:56.092
But it's turned on with a diesel
generator, so it will be quite noisy.

59:56.175 --> 59:58.761
So the infected will all come
when they hear it.

59:59.429 --> 01:00:01.222
We'll discuss what to do.

01:00:03.266 --> 01:00:04.183
Tomorrow…

01:00:05.435 --> 01:00:06.269
morning…

01:00:08.313 --> 01:00:11.316
I will sort out what
I can give out tomorrow morning.

01:00:13.568 --> 01:00:15.612
You're going to share with everyone?

01:00:16.195 --> 01:00:18.448
- Sir, bless you.
- Thank you.

01:00:21.451 --> 01:00:22.285
Bless you.

01:00:27.790 --> 01:00:30.335
- Will he give us water?
- What about anything else?

01:00:30.418 --> 01:00:32.045
It seems like he has a lot of food.

01:00:32.128 --> 01:00:34.422
It's only right to share the water!

01:00:34.505 --> 01:00:36.799
Please tell him to share it with us.

01:00:36.883 --> 01:00:38.343
Calm down, please.

01:00:38.426 --> 01:00:40.720
We will share what we have first.

01:00:40.803 --> 01:00:44.724
He said he'll think about it
until tomorrow, so don't bother him.

01:00:46.184 --> 01:00:47.018
Let's go.

01:00:47.101 --> 01:00:48.436
He has a lot of water, right?

01:00:48.519 --> 01:00:50.188
- He might change his mind…
- Let's go!

01:00:50.271 --> 01:00:51.939
- Come on.
- He could change his mind.

01:00:52.023 --> 01:00:54.192
Come on, let's go downstairs.

01:00:57.111 --> 01:00:58.821
Hasn't Han Tae-seok contacted us yet?

01:00:58.905 --> 01:01:01.866
No. It looks like he'll contact us
when he wants to.

01:01:03.993 --> 01:01:06.329
- What are you looking for?
- You see…

01:01:09.248 --> 01:01:13.169
I got this when I was training
for the FBI SWAT team.

01:01:13.795 --> 01:01:15.213
And it's a large size.

01:01:17.382 --> 01:01:18.341
What about it?

01:01:18.424 --> 01:01:21.052
I want to say thank you
to the man on the 15th floor.

01:01:21.135 --> 01:01:23.346
He's a bit cranky, but he's generous.

01:01:23.429 --> 01:01:26.307
I have a T-shirt
from the Italian Championships.

01:01:26.391 --> 01:01:28.601
- Shall we take that too?
- No, keep that one.

01:01:45.451 --> 01:01:46.452
Honey.

01:01:46.536 --> 01:01:48.913
Yes, Young-in, it's me.

01:01:50.498 --> 01:01:52.709
Everything seems like a dream.

01:01:54.168 --> 01:01:56.671
I feel like I'd be home
when I wake up, but…

01:02:01.718 --> 01:02:03.302
What about our baby?

01:02:13.062 --> 01:02:13.980
She's fine.

01:02:14.564 --> 01:02:15.440
Honey.

01:02:18.234 --> 01:02:21.738
Can't you take our baby out first?

01:02:24.615 --> 01:02:26.826
There's a high chance of her
being born infected

01:02:26.909 --> 01:02:28.745
because she shares your blood.

01:02:30.872 --> 01:02:32.039
Honey.

01:02:32.123 --> 01:02:33.040
Yes?

01:02:35.251 --> 01:02:36.711
Never give up…

01:02:38.963 --> 01:02:41.841
on our baby, okay?

01:02:42.550 --> 01:02:43.551
Okay.

01:03:54.372 --> 01:03:57.875
We can't postpone the childbirth anymore.

01:03:59.710 --> 01:04:01.546
You will have to make a decision.

01:04:01.629 --> 01:04:04.257
If miscarriage were possible,
it would've happened already.

01:04:04.340 --> 01:04:06.717
If anything happens to the baby,

01:04:06.801 --> 01:04:08.886
it may worsen her state of infection.

01:04:12.223 --> 01:04:13.766
You still have to choose.

01:04:15.393 --> 01:04:17.436
You have to choose whom
you're going to save

01:04:17.520 --> 01:04:18.855
if you can save only one.

01:04:21.899 --> 01:04:23.317
I only have one choice.

01:04:26.863 --> 01:04:29.198
Ms. Yoon's blood test result is out.

01:04:29.740 --> 01:04:31.242
She has the antibody.

01:04:55.808 --> 01:04:56.642
I'll be back.

01:04:56.726 --> 01:04:57.935
Want me to go with you?

01:04:58.603 --> 01:05:00.980
No, he seems to get sensitive
whenever he sees you.

01:05:01.647 --> 01:05:04.317
That's how shy people are.
I'll be back soon.

01:05:06.152 --> 01:05:07.153
Be careful.

01:06:28.234 --> 01:06:29.443
Mr. Jung.

01:06:37.118 --> 01:06:38.494
I'm listening.

01:07:12.862 --> 01:07:16.073
What did he mean by a wrongdoing
that can't be undone?

01:07:16.157 --> 01:07:19.076
We got the background check results
for those in the apartment,

01:07:19.160 --> 01:07:20.828
and something's weird.

01:07:20.911 --> 01:07:22.788
Do you think Kim Se-hoon really did this?

01:07:22.872 --> 01:07:24.165
Someone died.

01:07:24.248 --> 01:07:26.250
That's not important right now.

01:07:26.333 --> 01:07:27.793
The food is gone!

01:07:27.877 --> 01:07:29.170
Are you in danger?

01:07:29.253 --> 01:07:30.880
Get the infiltration team ready.

01:07:30.963 --> 01:07:34.467
Please help us so Sae-bom can live safely.

01:07:36.635 --> 01:07:38.888
This will be my last favor.

01:07:38.971 --> 01:07:40.598
Yi-hyun!

01:07:43.726 --> 01:07:48.731
Subtitle translation by: Hae-lim Lee
